\title{zugrpc: Client for 'gRPC' Remote Procedure Calls over 'HTTP/2'}
\description{
A client for 'gRPC' remote procedure calls, written in 'R' on top of the 'HTTP/2' requests that 'zuhttp' makes. Implements the 'gRPC' wire protocol: length-prefixed messages, request headers and metadata, deadlines, cancellation, and the call status carried in 'HTTP' trailers, with error details decoded into structured conditions. Supports unary and server-streaming calls, with streamed responses read one message at a time. Messages are encoded and decoded by the caller, for example with 'zuproto'.
